OL,3,GNEWSAMurdered boy's family 'take
OL,4,Acomfort that truth prevailed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a 14-year-old boy stabbed
OL,7,Fto death on the Isle of Man has said
OL,8,Fher family takes comfort from the fact
OL,9,Fthe "truth has prevailed" after a
OL,10,Fteenager was convicted of his murder.
OL,12,FChristopher McBurnie died after being
OL,13,Fattacked with a kitchen knife in Ramsey
OL,14,Fon 29 May last year during a
OL,15,Fpre-arranged fight. The pair had argued
OL,16,Fand challenged each other on social
OL,17,Fmedia.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,448,445,260,140,0,100
