OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMurdered boy's family 'take
OL,4,Acomfort that truth prevailed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 16-year-old, who cannot be named
OL,7,Fbecause of his age, was found guilty of
OL,8,Fmurder on Friday following a four-week
OL,9,Ftrial at Douglas Courthouse. Jurors
OL,10,Frejected his claim that he had acted in
OL,11,Fself-defence.
OL,13,FIn a post on the Christopher's Legacy
OL,14,FFacebook page, Rebecca Parker said it
OL,15,Fhad been the "most terrifying,
OL,16,Femotional and heartbreaking time" and
OL,17,Fthat the family would spend the rest of
OL,18,Ftheir lives "missing him, loving him
OL,19,Fand fighting for his legacy".
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
